    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Eh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I go away for a couple years and I come back to find your tail's even fatter."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.6,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Wh-wh-whuh?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Gonna try and tell me you're with thick tails, too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "No no no no! It's not like I wanted it to grow so thick!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "*Whimper* I want a nice, thin tail just like Gavial's..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Well, shucks. *Clicks tongue* What a poor kid you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Though watching you fight back there, your Arts are pretty strong now, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "R... Really?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Yeah. Come over to Rhodes Island and be an operator. Should be no problem for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Ope... rator?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Operators are, uh... Well, I guess it's a job. Like me, I'm a Medic Operator."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I remember you were still learning from the shamans when I left, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Yep! I've been disciplining myself every day for you, Gavial, so one day you'd come back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "For me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Oh... um, by that, I mean, for when you come back so I could help you out! Like I did just now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Well, damn. You really did help out, then. Well done."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Eheheh... I love when you compliment me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Cool. Let's keep moving then. Do I remember the Temple's just ahead?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Mm-hm."
