    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Brother, come on. Stop trying to make a show. You've got the Stone Disease and all. Just go back home and lie down, okay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Who cares! What's a little disease in the face of the ceremony?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "A little disease is still disease! And think about how bad it'd be for us if you went out there and showed everyone the rocks growing on your tail!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Look, Gavial might be gone, but now Zumama's sure to be the next Great Chief!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "That's the part I care about! I need to witness the moment Zumama becomes Chief!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "Damnit, I should have listened to Zumama... huh? Brother, look over there!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "It couldn't be. Is that... Gavial?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "Has she come back to become Great Chief?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071",
            "name2": "avg_npc_070",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B",
        "text": "...I'm sorry, but now I HAVE to see the ceremony."
    },
